# Admin API requests (VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP client).
# Needs ADMIN_USER_IDS to include your user id, or ADMIN_MOCK_ALLOW_ALL=true in development.

@base = http://localhost:3000
@email = you@example.com
@password = your-password

### Log in, then copy accessToken from the response into @token below
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

###
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE

### Analytics overview (DAU, page views, session duration: 7 and 30 days)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/analytics/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Tracking config (Clarity + GA measurement ids)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/config/tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Service health (database, storage, DeepL)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/health/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### No token: expect 401
GET {{base}}/api/admin/health/services
